PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786745068
OL,3,C'Will never give up hope' says Arlene
OL,4,CArkinson's sister
OL,6,F"I just hope her remains are found.
OL,8,F"And if anybody... just appeal to
OL,9,Fanybody that knows anything out there,
OL,10,Fplease come forward."
OL,12,FArlene was last seen in a car driven
OL,13,Fby notorious murderer and killer
OL,14,FRobert Howard. He was a rapist and a
OL,15,Fchild killer, who offered to drive
OL,16,FArlene home.
OL,18,FExtensive searches throughout the
OL,19,Fdecades have failed to locate her
OL,20,Fremains.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
