OL,3,C'Will never give up hope' says Arlene
OL,4,CArkinson's sister
OL,6,FHoward was tried and acquitted of
OL,7,FArlene's murder but the jury wasn't
OL,8,Ftold of his sexual and violent
OL,9,Foffending dating back to the 1960's.
OL,11,FHe went on to kill again, murdering a
OL,12,Fteenage girl in England seven years
OL,13,Flater.
OL,15,FEventually a long running inquest
OL,16,Ffound he was responsible for Arlene's
OL,17,Fdeath. He died in 2015, taking his
OL,18,Fsecrets to the grave.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/5
