OL,3,C'Will never give up hope' says Arlene
OL,4,CArkinson's sister
OL,6,FThe Atkinson family believe he was an
OL,7,FRUC informer and have long demanded a
OL,8,Fpublic inquiry.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, Kathleen released yellow
OL,11,Froses into the sea in Arlene's memory.
